        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: The Walt Disney Company, Priceline.com, Lucasfilm\n- Places: Burbank, California\n- People: Cuba Gooding Jr.\n- Products: Red Tails, Daddy Day Camp\n- Topics: travel-related purchases, airline tickets, hotel stays\n\nFacts:\n- In 2007, Daddy Day Camp featured Cuba Gooding Jr. in a starring role.\n- In 2012, The Walt Disney Company acquired Lucasfilm at a valuation of $4.06 billion.\n- Red Tails was Cuba Gooding Jr.'s first theatrically released film in five years after Daddy Day Camp.\n- The Walt Disney Company is an American diversified multinational mass media and entertainment conglomerate headquartered at the Walt Disney Studios in Burbank, California.\n- Priceline.com is an American company and commercial website that helps users find discount rates for travel-related purchases such as airline tickets and hotel stays.",
